{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0520000000000000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 3520,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# Regression specification and functional form\nRead from left to right: define the population and target, choose predictors and functional form, distinguish the specification layers, then use targeted diagnostics to investigate a repair. Open each linked title for the full explanation. Colours distinguish roles in this map.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n# 回归模型设定与函数形式\n\n从左到右读：**先固定目标与总体对象 → 决定变量和函数形式 → 分清失败层 → 用有方向的诊断形成可解释修复**。图中复用 OLS 原子而不复制第二套知识；点击卡片标题可打开 Markdown 原子。\n\n颜色只区分本图中的语义角色，不表示掌握度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[回归设定起点|Start with the question]]\nState the population, outcome, comparison, timing and use. Description, prediction and causal effects require different evidence. Available columns and significance do not choose the target.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[回归设定起点]]\n先写总体、结果、比较、时点和用途。描述、预测与因果效应需要不同证据；可用列和显著性不能替你选择目标。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[条件均值与线性投影|条件均值还是线性投影]]\n*Conditional mean vs. projection*\n\n完整条件均值与当前分布下的最佳线性近似不是同一对象；系数含义先取决于这一区分。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[参数线性|Linearity in parameters]]\nFixed feature functions can include powers, logs, interactions and spline terms. Their coefficients enter linearly. If feature-shape parameters are estimated too, check the enlarged parameterization and its constraints.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[参数线性]]\n固定特征函数可含幂、对数、交互和样条项，系数以线性形式进入；若同时估计特征形状，要检查扩大的参数化及其约束。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多元回归系数|Interpret the included columns]]\nHolding other columns fixed describes the fitted equation. It adjusts only the controls and functional forms actually included. A raw-variable change can move several columns; a causal interpretation requires separate identification.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多元回归系数]]\n保持其他列不变，首先描述拟合方程，只调整实际纳入的控制项和形式。原始变量变化可同时移动多列；因果解释另需识别。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[遗漏变量偏差|Omitted-variable bias]]\nRelative to a specified long-model coefficient, omitting one contributing, correlated term shifts the short projection’s slope. Other controls require partial association; several omitted contributions can cancel. This is not automatically finite-sample expectation bias.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[遗漏变量偏差]]\n相对指定长模型系数，省略一个有贡献且相关的项会移动短投影斜率。其他控制项要求看偏关联，多遗漏项可抵消；不能自动等同于有限样本期望偏差。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1160,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[无关变量代价|Irrelevant regressors and precision]]\nWith full column rank, full-design exogeneity and zero added contribution, both OLS fits remain unbiased. Spherical error covariance gives weakly larger true focal variance, possibly equal. Reported standard errors can move either way. Exact redundancy instead destroys coefficient uniqueness.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[无关变量代价]]\n满列秩、完整设计外生且新增贡献为零时，两次 OLS 仍无偏。球形误差下，焦点真实方差弱增且可相等；报告标准误可升可降。精确冗余则破坏系数唯一性。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[level-log 系数解释|level 与 log]]\n*Levels, logs, and units*\n\n谁取对数决定单位变化、半弹性或弹性；对因变量取 log 后，指数化拟合值通常不等于原尺度条件均值。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 1200,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[取值依赖边际效应|取值依赖的边际效应]]\n*Value-dependent marginal effects*\n\n平方项和交互项使完整边际效应成为系数组合；连续变量用导数，离散变量用有限差分。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1160,
      "y": 1200,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 360,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[设定问题分层|Layers of specification]]\nName the target first: a projection, conditional mean or causal effect. A curved mean can still have a valid linear summary. Mean changes, covariance corrections and identification assumptions address different questions; clean residuals do not prove causality.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[设定问题分层]]\n先说明目标：投影、条件均值还是因果效应。曲线均值仍可有有效的线性概括。修改均值、修正协方差和论证识别各答不同问题；残差规整不证明因果。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "052000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本正交与总体外生性|Orthogonality is a fitted identity]]\nResiduals are forced orthogonal to included columns by unrestricted OLS. This cannot establish zero conditional mean of the target model’s unobserved error. Compare fitted residuals with model errors before interpreting a diagnostic.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[样本正交与总体外生性]]\n无约束 OLS 强制残差与已含列正交，不能证明目标模型未观察误差的零条件均值。解释诊断前，先分清拟合残差与模型误差。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "052000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[残差图边界|Limits of residual plots]]\nThe horizontal axis determines what is visible. No pattern in one view does not exclude structure in another. Sample residual orthogonality is built into OLS; neither a clean plot nor zero correlation proves exogeneity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[残差图边界]]\n横轴决定可见方向。一张图没有模式，不排除另一方向有结构。样本残差正交由 OLS 强制；图形规整或零相关都不证明外生性。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "052000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[LM设定检验|LM: specified mean directions]]\nRegress restricted residuals on retained regressors and prespecified additions. Count new independent directions. The usual nR² reference is asymptotic and needs valid sampling and moment conditions; a fixed-design Gaussian F test is a different calibration.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[LM设定检验]]\n受限残差对原回归量及预定新增项回归，数真正独立的新方向。常用 nR² 参考是渐近的，需要抽样与矩条件；固定设计正态 F 检验使用另一种校准。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "052000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2320,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RESET检验边界|Ramsey RESET]]\nAdd prespecified powers of original fitted values, retaining the original regressors. Use effective added rank and a justified reference law. Rejection does not locate a unique omitted cause; zero added rank is no test, not a pass.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[RESET检验边界]]\n保留原回归量，加入原拟合值的预定幂。采用有效新增秩及有依据的参考分布。拒绝不定位唯一遗漏原因；新增秩为零是无法检验，不是通过。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "052000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[设定修复循环|Revising a regression]]\nTie each change to a target and a diagnosed problem; preserve an interpretable comparison and recheck the result. Better training fit is not future validation. If validation chooses a model, final evaluation needs evidence outside that selection.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[设定修复循环]]\n每次修改都对应目标和具体问题，保留可解释比较，并重新诊断。训练拟合改善不代表未来验证；验证数据参与选模后，最终评价需要选择过程之外的证据。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "052000000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[偏残差图|Partial-residual plot]]\nAdd one fitted predictor contribution back to the residual, then plot against that predictor. This reveals remaining shape under the other terms’ specification; it does not remove every association with the controls.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[偏残差图]]\n把一个变量的拟合贡献加回残差，再对该变量作图。解释形状仍取决于其他项的设定，并非清除了与控制变量的一切关联。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0520000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2320,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[附加变量图|Added-variable plot]]\nRemove the controls’ linear contributions from both the outcome and the chosen predictor. Under the OLS rank conditions, the residual-on-residual slope equals its partial coefficient. This view is not a general nonlinear-shape test.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[附加变量图]]\n从结果和所关注变量中分别扣除控制项的线性贡献。在 OLS 秩条件下，双残差回归斜率等于控制后系数；这不是一般的非线性形状检验。",
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
